<title>FRANCE: French coffee imports little changed yr/yr in Sept.</title>
<headline>French coffee imports little changed yr/yr in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French coffee imports in September issued by French customs included (in tonnes) -</p>
<p>- Coffee not roasted not decaffeinated -</p>
<p>		  Sept 96    Sept 95   Jan/Sept96   Jan/Sept95</p>
<p> Ivory Coast   3,869	4,223	35,438	  33,946</p>
<p> Cameroon	1,944	1,042	13,171	   8,046</p>
<p> Brazil	  4,954	4,776	32,096	  40,258</p>
<p> Colombia	2,364	2,578	24,831	  23,957</p>
<p> World total  25,906     25,542     239,594	 220,843</p>
<p>Unroasted decaffeinated coffee unavailable, more recent customs data unavailable.</p>
</text>
